    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Take this array of sorted email items: {{ JSON.stringify($items()) }}\n\nFormat the summary as a beautiful, professional modern HTML email template for a Technical Program Manager. \n\nRequirements:\n1. Use inline CSS styles for clean display across email clients (Gmail, Outlook, Apple Mail).\n2. Wrap everything in a main container with max-width: 650px, sans-serif font, and soft background colors (#f8f9fa).\n3. Group emails into distinct visual card sections by Priority:\n   - 🚨 URGENT (Red accent border/badge: #dc3545)\n   - ⚡ ACTION NEEDED (Orange accent border/badge: #fd7e14)\n   - ℹ️ FYI (Blue accent border/badge: #0d6efd)\n4. Display items inside each section using a clean HTML <table> with proper cell padding, border-bottom separators, and bold headers (Item, Summary, Action).\n5. Output ONLY pure, valid HTML code inside <div> tags. Do NOT use markdown code blocks (```html) or Markdown syntax (# or |).",
        "batching": {}
      },
